      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "760．求下列各式的值：",
        "а）$(5.7a^2b-3.1ab+8b^3)-(6.9ab-2.3a^2b+8b^3)$，",
        "当 $a=2$，$b=5$ 时；",
        "б）$5x^2-(3xy-7x^2)+(5xy-12x^2)$，",
        "当 $x=-0.28$，$y=0.4$ 时．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "761",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "761．给同学们出了这样一道题：",
        "“求下式的值，$(7a^3-6a^2b+5ab^2)+(3a^3+7a^2b+3ab^2)$",
        "$-(10a^3+a^2b+8ab^2)$ 当 $a=-0.25$，$b=-0.347$ 时”．有",
        "一名同学指出，在这道题里，给出的条件是多余的．他",
        "的说法对不对？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "762",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "762．证明：下列各式的值和包含在式内的变量值无关：",
        "а）$1.7-10b^2-(1-3b^2)+(2.3+7b^2)$；",
        "б）$1-b^2-(3b-2b^2)+(1+3b-b^2)$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "763",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "763．下列命题哪个是正确的？",
        "а）任意三个连续自然数的和能被 3 整除；",
        "б）任意四个连续自然数的和能被 4 整除．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "764",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "764．求多项式，用它代替 $M$ 以后，下列等式成为恒等式：",
        "а）$M+(5x^2-2xy)=6x^2+9xy-y^2$；",
        "б）$M-(4ab-3b^2)=a^2-7ab+8b^2$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "765",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "765．填上空着的项，使下列各式成为恒等式：",
        "а）$(5x^2+\\ast-7)+(\\ast-4x+\\ast)=x^2+2x+1$；",
        "б）$(\\ast-6y+13)-(9y^2-\\ast+\\ast)=2y^2+3y-4$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "766",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "766．证明：",
        "а）任意两个形如 $\\overline{ab}$ 与 $\\overline{ba}$ 的二位数的和能被 11 整除；",
        "б）任意两个形如 $\\overline{ab}$ 与 $\\overline{ba}$ 的二位数的差能被 9 整除．"
      ]
    },
